{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">「四哥」謝賢早前因肺炎與世長辭，享年89歲，告別了他璀璨的演藝人生。本月適逢四哥的90歲冥壽，女兒謝婷婷在社交平台上載了多張與爸爸的珍貴合照，字裏行間流露出對亡父的無盡思念與不捨，感動無數網民。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"jennifertsetingting_1786335572_3960386434139221661_7938415.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026FbjOT1ubPy1786344856.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"jennifertsetingting_1786335572_3960386434139221661_7938415.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">面對摯親離世，謝婷婷坦言心情難以平復。她以英文寫下一段極具深情的長文悼念父親，當中更不忘以幽默的方式提起四哥標誌性的「黑超」，盡顯父女間的默契與溫馨：</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">「Happy Birthday, Daddy. I really, really miss you…. we all really, really miss you… Saying goodbye to you was the hardest thing I’ve ever had to do in my life. But I hope you’re happy and free now. And I’m sure wherever you are, it’s so bright and beautiful that wearing sunglasses all the time is totally normal. 😎 Thank you for being my dad, and for being such a big part of who I am. Rest peacefully, Daddy. I love you. Always.<strong>（父親生日快樂，我真的很想念你，我們大家也很想念你。與你告別，是我人生中必須面對最艱難的事。但我希望你現在開心和感到自由。我肯定無論你現在身在何處，那裏都一定是如此明亮和美麗，美麗得讓你一直戴著太陽眼鏡也是完全正常的。😎 感謝你成為我的父親，爸爸我永遠愛你。）」</strong>一字一句，都深深流露著婷婷對四哥的敬愛與無盡思念。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"jennifertsetingting_1786335572_3960386436580262310_7938415.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026WVRxhtrs6k1786344856.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"jennifertsetingting_1786335572_3960386436580262310_7938415.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"jennifertsetingting_1786335572_3960386442854965594_7938415.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026uKCJmA0RY01786344856.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"jennifertsetingting_1786335572_3960386442854965594_7938415.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在婷婷分享的系列照片中，記錄了她由童年到成年，與爸爸共度的美好時光。每一張相片裡的四哥，臉上都掛著親切而溫暖的笑容，眼神中滿溢著對女兒的慈愛，父女情深溢於言表。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">當中最引人注目的，是一張罕見的<strong>三代同堂溫馨大合照</strong>。相中四哥精神奕奕地坐在中間，身旁有愛女謝婷婷、外籍女婿，以及被愛心圖案遮掩樣貌的寶貝孫女。當時一家人正開心為四哥慶祝生日，畫面溫馨滿瀉。雖然此情此景已成追憶，但四哥溫暖的笑容與滿滿的父愛，將會永遠留在家人與大眾的心中。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">另外，四哥的好友、婷婷的契媽汪明荃亦留言表示「我都好想念佢」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T07:20:49.200639+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1012,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}